#: ../../source/docs/job-openings.rst:5 2b275837fb944b55b4f789a2261743dc
msgid "Job Openings in Dev Team"
msgstr "开发团队职位空缺"

#: ../../source/docs/job-openings.rst:7 2ac76b7293ed47079c7e4c291830bba6
msgid ""
"ArduPilot is looking for new team members to fill the following vacant "
"positions. These are mostly unpaid positions but the successful application "
"can look forward to becoming a core member of the team with excellent "
"learning opportunities through extensive access to all the other core "
"developers."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot "
"正在招募新团队成员填补以下空缺职位。这些职位大多为无薪岗位，但成功加入者可期望成为核心团队成员，并通过广泛接触所有其他核心开发者获得宝贵的学习机会。"

#: ../../source/docs/job-openings.rst:12 620ecce8097d46108932926b541d7aa5
msgid ""
"In general the best way to take on these positions is to :ref:`make contact "
"<common-contact-us>` with a member of the dev team (i.e. Tridge, Randy, etc)"
" to express your desire to take on the position then contribute to the "
"code/wiki in line with the responsibilities for the role written below.  If "
"all goes well, after some period of successful contribution you can look "
"forward to officially taking on the title."
msgstr ""
"通常，最好的方式是 :ref:`联系 <common-contact-us>` 开发团队的某位成员（如 Tridge、Randy "
"等），表达您对该职位的兴趣，然后按照下文所述的职责要求为代码/wiki 做出贡献。如果一切顺利，经过一段时间的成功贡献后，您可以期待正式获得该头衔。"

#: ../../source/docs/job-openings.rst:14 c0393714d8584713866e094a3a8597e2
msgid ""
"Currently all positions are filled, but check back on this page every few "
"months if you have an interest, for changes."
msgstr "目前所有职位均已填满，但如果您有兴趣，请每隔几个月回来查看此页面，了解最新动态。"
